    "chunk_text": "\u0dc1\u0dca\u200d\u0dbb\u0dd3 \u0dbd\u0d82\u0d9a\u0dcf\u0dd9 \u0dc3\u0db3 \u0dcf \u0dc3\u0dcf\u0dd9\u0dcf\u0db1\u0dba\u0dba \u0d9a\u0dcf\u0dbd\u0d9c\u0dd4\u0dab \u0d85\u0db1\u0dcf\u0dd9\u0dd0\u0d9a\u0dd2\u0dba GENERAL WEATHER FORECAST FOR SRI LANKA \u0da2\u0dcf\u0dad\u0dd2\u0d9a \u0d9a\u0dcf\u0dbd\u0d9c\u0dd4\u0dab \u0dc0\u0dd2\u0daf\u0dba\u0dcf \u0dd9\u0db0\u0dba\u0dc3\u0dda\u0dae\u0dcf\u0db1\u0db8\u0dda, \u0d85\u0db1\u0dcf\u0dd9\u0dd0\u0d9a\u0dd2 \u0d85\u0d82\u0dc1\u0dba \u0dd9\u0d9c\u0dd2\u0db1\u0dca \u0db1\u0dd2\u0d9a\u0dd4\u0dad\u0dca \u0d9a\u0dbb\u0db1 \u0dbd\u0daf\u0dd2 Issued by Forecasting Division, National Meteorological Centre\n\nGENERAL WEATHER FORECAST FOR NEXT 36 HOURS\n\nIssued at 04.00 p.m. on 15 November 2026\n\nDue to the influence of this system, cloudy skies will prevail over the entire island tomorrow. Several spells of showers will occur in the Northern, North-central, Eastern, Western, Sabaragamuwa and North-western provinces and in the Kandy, Nuwara-Eliya, Galle and Matara districts.\n\nShowers or thundershowers may occur at a few places in the Uva province and in Hambantota district after 2.00 p.m.\n\nThe general public is kindly requested to take adequate precautions to minimize damage caused by temporary localized strong winds and lightning during thundershowers.\n\nMisty conditions may prevail in most parts of the island during the early morning hours.\n\nWeather Forecast for Main Cities Date : 28-Oct-2026\n\nCity Temperature (0C) Relative Humidity (%) Weather Max Min Max Min Anuradhapura 35 25 95 50 Showers or thundershowers after 2.00p.m Batticaloa 31 25 90 75 Showers or thundershowers are likely after 2.00p.m\n\nColombo 30 25 90 60 Showers or thundershowers after 2.00p.m Galle 30 26 90 80 Showers or thundershowers after 2.00p.m\n\nJaffna 34 27 90 65 Showers or thundershowers are likely after 2.00p.m Kandy 32 22 95 60 Showers or thundershowers after 2.00p.m\n\nNuwara-Eliya 22 12 95 70 Showers or thundershowers after