    "chunk_text": "Condition of Rain:\n\nMainly fair weather will prevail in the sea areas around the island.\n\nWinds:\n\nWinds will be North-westerly or Northerly in the sea areas around the island. Wind speed will be (30-40) kmph.\n\nState of Sea:\n\nThe sea areas off the coast extending from Kankasanthurai to Pottuvil via Trincomalee and Batticaloa will be rough at times. The other sea areas around the island will be moderate.\n\nTemporarily strong gusty winds (60-70 kmph) and very rough seas can be expected during thundershowers."
